<item ident="g22512a145dea0f4b58a1b70cd89cd680" title="Pergunta 4">
<itemmetadata>
<qtimetadata>
<qtimetadatafield>
<fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
<fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
</qtimetadatafield>
<qtimetadatafield>
<fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
<fieldentry>1.0</fieldentry>
</qtimetadatafield>
<qtimetadatafield>
<fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
<fieldentry>67159,57657,83839,41668</fieldentry>
</qtimetadatafield>
</qtimetadata>
</itemmetadata>
<presentation>
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;O que significa o prefixo &lt;strong&gt;pre&lt;/strong&gt; na palavra &lt;strong&gt;previewing&lt;/strong&gt;?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
</material>
<response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
<render_choice>
<response_label ident="67159">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Antes</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
<response_label ident="57657">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Depois</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
<response_label ident="83839">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Durante</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
<response_label ident="41668">
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/plain">Novamente</mattext>
</material>
</response_label>
</render_choice>
</response_lid>
</presentation>
<resprocessing>
<outcomes>
<decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
</outcomes>
<respcondition continue="Yes">
<conditionvar>
<varequal respident="response1">67159</varequal>
</conditionvar>
<displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="67159_fb"/>
</respcondition>
<respcondition continue="Yes">
<conditionvar>
<varequal respident="response1">57657</varequal>
</conditionvar>
<displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="57657_fb"/>
</respcondition>
<respcondition continue="Yes">
<conditionvar>
<varequal respident="response1">83839</varequal>
</conditionvar>
<displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="83839_fb"/>
</respcondition>
<respcondition continue="Yes">
<conditionvar>
<varequal respident="response1">41668</varequal>
</conditionvar>
<displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="41668_fb"/>
</respcondition>
<respcondition continue="No">
<conditionvar>
<varequal respident="response1">67159</varequal>
</conditionvar>
<setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
</respcondition>
</resprocessing>
<itemfeedback ident="67159_fb">
<flow_mat>
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;O prefixo &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt; significa &lt;em&gt;antes&lt;/em&gt;. Previewing significa examinar um texto antes de realizar uma leitura detalhada.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
</material>
</flow_mat>
</itemfeedback>
<itemfeedback ident="57657_fb">
<flow_mat>
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;After&lt;/em&gt; (depois) é o oposto do que &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt; significa. &lt;em&gt;Pre&lt;/em&gt; significa &lt;em&gt;antes&lt;/em&gt;, e é por isso que o 'previewing' acontece antes de a leitura detalhada começar.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
</material>
</flow_mat>
</itemfeedback>
<itemfeedback ident="83839_fb">
<flow_mat>
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;During&lt;/em&gt; (durante) não descreve o significado de &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Pre&lt;/em&gt; significa &lt;em&gt;antes&lt;/em&gt;, e é por isso que o 'previewing' acontece antes de a leitura detalhada começar.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
</material>
</flow_mat>
</itemfeedback>
<itemfeedback ident="41668_fb">
<flow_mat>
<material>
<mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Again&lt;/em&gt; (novamente) não é o significado de &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Pre&lt;/em&gt; significa &lt;em&gt;antes&lt;/em&gt;, e é por isso que o 'previewing' acontece antes de a leitura detalhada começar.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
</material>
</flow_mat>
</itemfeedback>
</item>
<item ident="gd88ba0679cd8d98bca9730ae667fe715" title="Pergunta 40">
<itemmetadata>
